flowchart TD
    Start["What are you modelling?"]
    Behaviour["Reusable behaviour<br/>for an Object?"]
    Data["Stored data?"]
    AllRecords["Belongs directly to all Records<br/>of this Object?"]
    SameEntity["Role or context-specific data<br/>for the same entity?"]
    Independent["Independent entity or transaction?"]

    Trait["Trait"]
    Property["Property"]
    Extended["Extended Object"]
    Relation["New Object + Relation"]

    Start --> Behaviour
    Behaviour -->|Yes| Trait
    Behaviour -->|No| Data
    Data -->|Yes| AllRecords
    AllRecords -->|Yes| Property
    AllRecords -->|No| SameEntity
    SameEntity -->|Yes| Extended
    SameEntity -->|No| Independent
    Independent --> Relation
